            "Select...": [
                "V\u00e4lj..."
            ],
            "<strong>Simple Social Buttons<\/strong> by <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/wpbrigade.com\/?utm_source=simple-social-buttons-lite&utm_medium=link-header&utm_campaign=pro-upgrade\">WPBrigade<\/a><\/strong> adds an advanced set of social media sharing buttons to your WordPress sites, such as: <strong>Facebook<\/strong>, <strong>Twitter\/X<\/strong>, <strong>LinkedIn<\/strong>, <strong>WhatsApp<\/strong>, <strong>Viber<\/strong>, <strong>Reddit<\/strong> and <strong>Pinterest<\/strong>. This makes it the most flexible social sharing plugin for everyone.": [
                "<strong>Enkla sociala knappar<\/strong> fr\u00e5n <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/wpbrigade.com\/?utm_source=simple-social-buttons-lite&utm_medium=link-header&utm_campaign=pro-upgrade\">WPBrigade<\/a><\/strong> l\u00e4gger till ett avancerat set av knappar f\u00f6r delning p\u00e5 sociala medier till dina WordPress-sajter, s\u00e5som: <strong>Facebook<\/strong>, <strong>Twitter\/X<\/strong>, <strong>LinkedIn<\/strong>, <strong>WhatsApp<\/strong>, <strong>Viber<\/strong>, <strong>Reddit<\/strong> och <strong>Pinterest<\/strong>. Detta g\u00f6r det till det mest flexibla pluginet f\u00f6r delning p\u00e5 sociala medier f\u00f6r alla."
            ],
            "Control how share buttons appear on images and media within your posts.": [
                "Kontrollera hur delaknappar visas p\u00e5 bilder och media inom dina inl\u00e4gg."
            ],
            "Configure your share popup: set the message, timing, and trigger behavior.": [
                "Konfigurera din delningspopup: st\u00e4ll in meddelandet, tidpunkten och utl\u00f6sarens beteende."
            ],
            "Set up a slide-in share prompt with custom messaging, position, and timing": [
                "St\u00e4ll in en slid-in delningsprompt med anpassat meddelande, position och timing"
            ],
            "HTTP\/HTTPS Counts Resolve": [
                "HTTP\/HTTPS R\u00e4knare L\u00f6st"
            ],
