                "timme"
            ],
            "hours": [
                "timmar"
            ],
            "Internal share click counts are recorded for supported networks (for example Twitter\/X, LinkedIn, WhatsApp) when visitors use the sharing buttons on your site. Counts are stored locally and are not sent to those social networks. Clear your page cache after upgrading the plugin so button markup stays in sync.": [
                "Interna klickr\u00e4kningar f\u00f6r delning registreras f\u00f6r st\u00f6dda n\u00e4tverk (till exempel Twitter\/X, LinkedIn, WhatsApp) n\u00e4r bes\u00f6kare anv\u00e4nder delaknappen p\u00e5 din webbplats. R\u00e4knarna lagras lokalt och skickas inte till dessa sociala n\u00e4tverk. Rensa din sidcache efter att du har uppgraderat pluginet s\u00e5 att knappens markup f\u00f6rblir synkroniserad."
            ],
            "Enable to remove all settings upon uninstalling the plugin.": [
                "Aktivera f\u00f6r att ta bort alla inst\u00e4llningar vid avinstallering av pluginet."
            ],
            "Enable to reset all settings back to default upon saving.": [
                "Aktivera f\u00f6r att \u00e5terst\u00e4lla alla inst\u00e4llningar till standard vid sparande."
            ],
            "Click To Post": [
                "Klicka f\u00f6r att posta"
            ],
            "Unlock Click to Tweet Feature with Pro!": [
                "L\u00e5s upp Klicka f\u00f6r att Tweet-funktionen med Pro!"
            ],
            "Get the powerful Click to Tweet functionality that lets you create engaging, tweetable content directly in your posts. This Pro feature helps increase social engagement and drive more traffic to your site.": [
                "F\u00e5 den kraftfulla Klicka f\u00f6r att Tweet-funktionen som l\u00e5ter dig skapa engagerande, tweetbara inneh\u00e5ll direkt i dina inl\u00e4gg. Denna Pro-funktion hj\u00e4lper till att \u00f6ka sociala engagemang och driva mer trafik till din webbplats."
            ],
            "Click here to Upgrade": [
