            ],
            "Loading Pro component...": [
                "Laddar Pro-komponent..."
            ],
            "Configure how your inline share buttons appear within your content.": [
                "Konfigurera hur dina inlinjedelarknappar visas inom ditt inneh\u00e5ll."
            ],
            "For Facebook share count you need to add Facebook App ID and Secret in the Social tab.": [
                "F\u00f6r Facebook-delningr\u00e4kning beh\u00f6ver du l\u00e4gga till Facebook App ID och Secret i fliken Social."
            ],
            "Show only a set number of icons in your content. Remaining icons open in a popup when visitors tap the + button.": [
                "Visa endast ett begr\u00e4nsat antal ikoner i ditt inneh\u00e5ll. \u00c5terst\u00e5ende ikoner \u00f6ppnas i en popup n\u00e4r bes\u00f6kare trycker p\u00e5 + knappen."
            ],
            "This text appears on your site as a heading above the inline share buttons. It is not used as the title when someone shares your content on social networks.": [
