            "Required for Facebook share counts. Add your App ID and Secret from the Facebook developer portal.": [
                "Kr\u00e4vs f\u00f6r Facebook-delningstal. L\u00e4gg till ditt App-ID och hemlighet fr\u00e5n Facebooks utvecklarportal."
            ],
            "Facebook App Secret": [
